{"seq":1,"slug":"the-school-of-mind","title":"The School Of Mind","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/the-school-of-mind","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-is-principle","title":"心即理","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/the-school-of-mind/mind-is-principle","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"completing-neo-confucianism","title":"心学的集大成","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/the-school-of-mind/completing-neo-confucianism","wordCount":1472,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现王阳明的根本命题\"心即理\"及其作为心学集大成者的地位。\"心即理\"主张，天理不在外物，而就在人的本心之中——它从根本上改变了求理（成圣）的方向，由向外转为向内，是心学区别于程朱理学的基石。王阳明承陆九渊而来，建构了成熟、完整的心学体系，将心学发展到顶峰，使之成为足以与程朱理学并立的伟大传统。本章揭示王阳明心学的根本立场与历史地位。\n"}